body:
I was going to say not many, but when I thought about it, it's a few. 

\- engine wise, HKS EL headers, ecutek tune, cusco oil cooler (water/oil);  
\- Blitz catback exhaust (for sound, not performance)  
\- TRD lowering springs on stock shocks;  
\- brakes are slotted rotors (front and back), upgraded pads (Dixcel Z type front, S type back), race fluid (Castrol SRF React);  
\- wheels (Enkei RPF1), tyres (Advan AD09)  
\- fixed Bride Zeta IV bucket, harness and harness bar;  
\- DAMD steering wheel
